              "diagnosis": "函数 get_allen_relation 中区间关系判断顺序与条件存在缺陷。第 14 行 `elif ie1 >= is2 and ie1 <= ie2 and is1 <= is2: return 'overlaps'` 与第 16 行 `elif ie2 >= is1 and ie2 <= ie1 and is2 <= is1: return 'overlapped_by'` 的条件过于宽松：当 is1 == is2 且 ie1 < ie2（starts）时，is1<=is2 且 ie1>=is2 且 ie1<=ie2 成立，会先返回 'overlaps'；当 is1 == is2 且 ie1 > ie2（started_by）时，is2<=is1 且 ie2>=is1 且 ie2<=ie1 成立，会先返回 'overlapped_by'；当 ie1 == ie2 且 is2 < is1（finishes）时，is1<=is2 不成立但 is2<=is1 成立且 ie2>=is1、ie2<=ie1 成立，会先返回 'overlapped_by'；当 ie1 == ie2 且 is2 > is1（finished_by）时，is1<=is2 且 ie1>=is2 且 ie1<=ie2 成立，会先返回 'overlaps'。因此 starts/started_by/finishes/finished_by 四个用例失败。根因是 overlaps/overlapped_by 分支未排除共享端点的情形，且判断顺序应让更具体的关系（starts/started_by/finishes/finished_by/during/contains）先于 overlaps/overlapped_by 判断。",
